/**

@page introduction Introduction

`Xlsxwriter++` is a C++ library for writing files in the Excel 2007+ XLSX
file format.

It can be used to write text, numbers, formulas and hyperlinks to multiple
worksheets, to draw several charts and it supports features such as formatting.

The main advantages of using `Xlsxwriter++` are:

- It has a high degree of fidelity with files produced by Excel. In
  most cases the files produced are 100% equivalent to files
  produced by Excel.
- It has extensive documentation, example files and tests.

However:

- It can only create **new files**. It cannot read or modify
  existing files.

`Xlsxwriter++` is a C++ port of [libxlsxwriter](https://github.com/jmcnamara/libxlsxwriter) from John McNamara.

Next: @ref getting_started

*/
